This crate implements no cryptography and ports no third-party source. It reads
the Esplora REST API, whose route shapes and JSON field names are those of
Blockstream's esplora (https://github.com/Blockstream/esplora), and matches the
rejection wordings emitted by Bitcoin Core's `sendrawtransaction`.

The reconciliation rules, their rationale and their tests were written for
SilkMoney's atomic-swap watchtower and browser swap driver, and are extracted
here unchanged in behaviour.
